<title>ZAIRE: SOCCER-DRAGONS BEAT RENAISSANCE 6-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DRAGONS BEAT RENAISSANCE 6-1.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaire's Dragons beat Chad's Renaissance 6-1 (halftime 2-1) in the second leg of their African Cup Winners' Cup match on Monday, qualifying for the quarter-finals 7-3 on aggregate.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dragons - Banzamba Ipotele (12, 87 minutes), Tutu Liongo (45), Kanka Mulowayi (65), Tokala Bolombo (72), Manianga Banza (80).</p>
<p>Renaissance - Gana Hisseine (16)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
